# text = 1:06:29 Nā Wai Kaulana < Kaʻapuni ʻoe a puni ʻo Maui e ʻike Nā Wai ʻEhā ʻO Waikapū, Wailuku, Waiehu Kaulana Nā Wai ʻEhā e ʻīnikiniki mālie ʻO Waiheʻe i ka makani Kiliʻoʻopu Nā wai kaulana ia kuʻu ʻāina ʻIke ʻia i ka nani o Maui, ke pani wai aʻo ʻĪao Ke kokolo a ka uahi aʻo Kula me he uhiwai ala o ka uka Kaʻapuni ʻoe a puni ʻo Maui e ʻike Nā Wai ʻEhā ʻO Waikapū, Wailuku, Waiehu Kaulana Nā Wai ʻEhā e ʻīnikiniki mālie ʻO Waiheʻe i ka makani Kiliʻoʻopu Nā wai kaulana ia kuʻu ʻāina ʻIke ʻia i ka nani o Maui, ke pani wai aʻo ʻĪao Ke kokolo a ka uahi aʻo Kula me he uhiwai ala o ka uka Kaʻapuni ʻoe a puni ʻo Maui e ʻike Nā Wai ʻEhā ʻO Waikapū, Wailuku, Waiehu Kaulana Nā Wai ʻEhā e ʻīnikiniki mālie ʻO Waiheʻe i ka makani Kiliʻoʻopu Nā wai kaulana ia kuʻu ʻāina 1:08:16 Nā wai kaulana ia kuʻu ʻāina Mahalo.
